[node name="Room02" type="Node2D"]
editor_description = "1) An 88 px gap: too wide to jump, so jump and dash (X) across. 2) A 144 px pit with the first wind crystal in the middle: dash to it, it refills you, dash again. 3) Three crystals over a spike floor: chain jump, dash, dash, dash to the exit. The chain is in dead air (mauve, hatched): no gliding there."
